  "description": "Three-step, tool-free fold — no latches, no bolts. The Jetty collapses smaller than a carry-on suitcase and fits in any car trunk, under a desk, or in an RV storage bay. Folded: 18\" W × 31\" L × 27\" H\n\nThe Lectric XP weighs 64 lbs. The Rad Power weighs 62 lbs. The Jetty 4.0 weighs 45 lbs — light enough to carry up four flights of stairs with one hand, lift into an Uber trunk, or bring inside instead of locking up outside.\n\nMost bikes — even expensive ones — use spoked wheels that go out of true and break under stress. The Jetty 4.0 uses cast magnesium alloy wheels with no spokes to break or true. Ever.\n\nEvery competing folding ebike at $999 uses an unbranded, anonymous hub motor. The Jetty 4.0 runs a Bafang 350W motor — one of the three largest ebike motor manufacturers in the world, alongside Bosch and Shimano.",
